.md
Now we can call `drawArray` repeatedly in a loop to update the field:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Now we can call `drawArray` repeatedly in a loop to update the field:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
board = RandomInteger[1, {40, 40}];

Do[
  board = CellularAutomaton["GameOfLife", board];
  drawArray[board] // FrontSubmit;
  Pause[0.1];
, {i,1,50}]

